{"4704680":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"财富大爆炸","steam_appid":4704680,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wealth Big Bang<\/i> is a clicker idle game focused on wealth accumulation and endless growth.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from a humble temporary shack, you will expand your wealth empire through clicking, automation, asset upgrades, and strategic decisions. As your progress advances, you will unlock higher-level systems such as universe rules and creation simulation, allowing you to continuously break through the limits of wealth and numbers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From tiny early profits to a universe-spanning financial civilization, every stage of growth introduces new ways to expand and optimize your strategy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for players who enjoy idle progression, incremental growth, and long-term development systems.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless wealth expansion and progression<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combined clicker and automation income systems<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-universe rules and strategic choices<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different build paths and growth styles<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive multipliers and exponential scaling<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collection, lottery, and long-term progression systems<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich achievement unlocking content<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow from a small shack into a universe-level wealth civilization<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wealth Big Bang<\/i> is a clicker idle game focused on wealth accumulation and endless growth.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from a humble temporary shack, you will expand your wealth empire through clicking, automation, asset upgrades, and strategic decisions. As your progress advances, you will unlock higher-level systems such as universe rules and creation simulation, allowing you to continuously break through the limits of wealth and numbers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From tiny early profits to a universe-spanning financial civilization, every stage of growth introduces new ways to expand and optimize your strategy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for players who enjoy idle progression, incremental growth, and long-term development systems.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless wealth expansion and progression<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combined clicker and automation income systems<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-universe rules and strategic choices<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different build paths and growth styles<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive multipliers and exponential scaling<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collection, lottery, and long-term progression systems<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich achievement unlocking content<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow from a small shack into a universe-level wealth civilization<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Wealth Explosion is an idle game with endless growth, divine trials, and deckbuilding. Rise from a shack to become the universe's richest being and the God of Reincarnation. Collect artifacts, challenge gods, explore adventures, and build decks. For fans of idle games and roguelites.","supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese, English, Traditional Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704680\/f5704b16b6dd22e7c492bb594feceb0d103aefaf\/header.jpg?t=1793767813","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4704680\/65a84968913ea31a50db1e4e6db370714c0349d3\/capsu